      "text": "Harden leads all scorers with 24 points. Pacers have held Mitchell to five on 2 of 7 shooting. Oubre 13 points. Nembhard 11 and four assists. Siakam nine and he's 1 of 4 at the line. Zubac and Toppin nine each.",
